S2('tm','Networking','Create a Traffic Manager Profile','Route DNS queries to healthy endpoints across regions.',2,5,'Traffic Manager profiles>Create','Enter a unique <b>Name</b> (name.trafficmanager.net) and choose the <b>Routing method</b>.|Select group and <b>Create</b>.|Open <b>Endpoints</b> → <b>Add</b>: type, name, target, priority or weight.|Under <b>Configuration</b> set DNS TTL and the health probe protocol, port and path.','Endpoint monitor status Online; nslookup returns the expected endpoint.','Delete the profile.','Endpoint Degraded => probe path or port wrong.|Slow failover => lower DNS TTL.','traffic-manager/quickstart-create-traffic-manager-profile','Network Contributor|Endpoints with public addresses','Client DNS>Traffic Manager>Endpoint>Application','Routing method~Performance, Weighted, Priority, Geographic~Selection logic|DNS TTL~Low value~Failover speed|Probe path~/health~Health check','Use a real health endpoint|Combine with regional load balancers','lb agw',[],'Traffic Manager is DNS-based and does not inspect traffic.','Plan TTL and nested profiles.'),
S2('afd','Networking','Create an Azure Front Door Profile','Deliver and secure global web apps with a Layer 7 entry point.',3,5,'Front Door and CDN profiles>Create>Azure Front Door','Choose <b>Quick create</b> or <b>Custom create</b>.|Set name, <b>Tier</b> (Standard or Premium) and endpoint name.|Select the origin type and origin host name.|Optionally attach a WAF policy.|<b>Review + create</b>, then <b>Create</b>.|Open <b>Front Door manager</b> to add routes, and <b>Origin groups</b> to tune health probes.','Endpoint host name serves the origin; origin health is Healthy.','Delete the profile and WAF policy.','Origin unhealthy => probe settings or origin firewall.|Wrong content => route patterns and caching.','frontdoor/create-front-door-portal','Contributor on the group|Origin app reachable|Domain plan','Client>Front Door edge>WAF>Origin','Tier~Standard or Premium~Premium adds private link origins and advanced WAF|Origin type~App Service, Storage, custom~Backend|Health probe~HTTPS path~Origin health','Use WAF in Prevention mode|Restrict origins to Front Door traffic','agw tm',[],'Lock origins to Front Door with the service tag and header check.','Use custom domains with managed certificates.','Billed per profile plus traffic and requests.'),
S2('queue','Storage','Create an Azure Storage Queue','Create a message queue for asynchronous workloads.',1,6,'Storage accounts>Select account>Data storage>Queues>+ Queue','Enter a lowercase queue <b>Name</b> and select <b>OK</b>.|Open the queue → <b>+ Add message</b>, enter the text and expiry.|Select <b>OK</b>.','Message count increases; dequeue works from the app.','Delete the queue (all messages are lost).','403 => data-plane role Storage Queue Data Contributor.|Message gone => expiry time reached.','storage/queues/storage-quickstart-queues-portal','Storage Account Contributor|Account exists','Producer>Queue>Consumer','Queue name~orders~3-63 lowercase characters|Message time-to-live~7 days default~Retention','Use poison-queue handling|Consumers must be idempotent','st stfw',[],'Use Entra ID roles instead of keys.','Monitor queue length.'),
