S2('disk','Storage','Create and Attach a Managed Disk','Add a data disk to a VM.',2,6,'Disks>Create','<b>Basics</b>: group, name, region, zone, source type, and <b>Size</b> (choose disk SKU).|<b>Encryption</b>: platform-managed key or customer-managed key.|<b>Review + create</b>.|Open the VM → <b>Settings</b> → <b>Disks</b> → <b>Attach existing disks</b> → select the disk → <b>Save</b>.|Initialize, partition and mount the disk in the OS.','Disk shows Attached; OS sees and mounts it.','Detach in the VM, then delete the disk.','Disk not visible in OS => initialize it.|Cannot attach => disk and VM must share region and zone.','virtual-machines/linux/attach-disk-portal','Virtual Machine Contributor|VM exists','Managed disk>VM>OS volume','Disk SKU~Standard SSD or Premium SSD~Performance and cost|Size~Per workload~Capacity and IOPS|Encryption~Platform-managed or CMK~At-rest key|Zone~Match the VM~Attach requirement','Premium SSD for production|Snapshots or Backup for protection','vm bkp',[('CLI','az vm disk attach -g rg-app-dev-001 --vm-name dev-app-vm01 --name disk-data01 --new --size-gb 128','Creates and attaches a 128 GiB data disk.')],'Use disk encryption with CMK where required.','Match disk SKU to IOPS needs.','Premium disks cost more; unattached disks still bill.'),
S2('actlog','Monitoring','Query and Export the Activity Log','See who did what to which resource and keep the history longer.',1,9,'Monitor>Activity log','Set <b>Timespan</b>, subscription and scope.|Add filters: resource group, resource type, operation, <b>Event initiated by</b>, severity.|Open an event → <b>JSON</b> tab for details.|Select <b>Export Activity Logs</b> → <b>Add diagnostic setting</b> to send to Log Analytics or storage.|Optionally <b>Create activity log alert</b>.','Events listed for the chosen scope; export shows data in the workspace.','Remove the diagnostic setting.','Event missing => widen the timespan; the log keeps 90 days.|Failed operation => open the JSON for the error.','azure-monitor/essentials/activity-log','Reader on the scope|Monitoring Contributor to export','Azure operations>Activity log>Diagnostic setting>Workspace','Timespan~Last 24 hours~Search window|Event initiated by~User or service principal~Who|Severity~Error or Warning~Importance','Export to Log Analytics for longer retention','law alert',[('KQL','AzureActivity\n| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d) and ActivityStatusValue == "Failure"\n| project TimeGenerated, Caller, OperationNameValue, ResourceGroup','Lists failed operations in the last day.')],'Alert on role assignment and policy changes.','Retain longer than 90 days.'),
