S2('spot','Cost','Create a Spot Virtual Machine','Run interruptible workloads at a discount on spare capacity.',2,11,'Virtual machines>Create>Azure virtual machine>Basics','In <b>Basics</b>, set group, name, region, image and size.|Tick <b>Run with Azure Spot discount</b>.|Choose <b>Eviction type</b>, <b>Eviction policy</b> (Stop/Deallocate or Delete) and <b>Max price</b>.|Complete the remaining tabs and <b>Review + create</b>.','VM Running; Spot settings visible on the VM.','Delete the VM and its disk, NIC and IP.','Evicted => capacity or price; design for interruption.|Size unavailable as Spot => pick another size.','virtual-machines/spot-portal','Contributor on the group|Workload that tolerates interruption','Spare capacity>Spot VM>Eviction>Restart','Eviction type~Capacity only or price~Why evicted|Eviction policy~Deallocate~Keeps the disk|Max price~Up to pay-as-you-go~Cost ceiling','Use for batch, test and stateless jobs','vm vmss',[],'Treat Spot VMs as disposable.','Never for stateful production.','Discount depends on capacity; evicted VMs may stop at any time.'),
